<Behavior #xnl-structured-edit-conformance apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #native-revision-seams (
      <Statement ?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4S>

      公共 XNL 编辑链 SHALL 保留原生结构、稳定 identity 和事务边界；VCS checkpoint SHALL 不成为 live authority。
      </?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4S>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #public-conformance { name = "公共结构与 revision 接缝" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #native-values (
              <Given ?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4T>

              原生嵌套对象数组及稳定节点 identity
              </?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4T>
              <When ?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4V>

              diff 后严格 dryRun
              </?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4V>
              <Then ?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4W>

              完整目标结构重建且原输入保持不变；stale 前置值拒绝整批。
              </?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4W>
            )>
            <Case #revision-boundaries (
              <Given ?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4X>

              两个文件共享一个 VFS revision 与历史 checkpoint
              </?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4X>
              <When ?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4Y>

              竞争提交和历史 checkout
              </?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4Y>
              <Then ?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4Z>

              只有一个 CAS 接受；失败不泄漏部分文件；checkout 不更改 live authority。
              </?01M1W290EKJDGPPGE8Y8NDXH4Z>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
